==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Zroco|Znache|Shibalien|Zackie Peng|Zoge|Doge Dark}}
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] (500%) spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] (500%) spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] (500%) spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shibalien]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s (500%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

