==Strategy==
All in all, not an easy [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]]. The same strategies as usual apply, but you may want to bring a Doge Dark counter like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] to make the ending easier.

